     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Describing stages and roles",
     "texto": [
      "Order stages with **først**, **deretter** and **til slutt**. Relative clauses with **som** identify groups: **personer som vil delta** («people who want to take part»). The passive can present the process (**Navnene registreres ved inngangen** «The names are registered at the entrance»), but also names who coordinates if relevant."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
